<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 8,380 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 3,200 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  176   (169 and 160)</p>
<p>    Good		168   (162 and 128)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     157   (152 and 118)</p>
<p>    Medium	    150   (146 and 109)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	100   (100 and  88)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 176 pence for a Kenya PF.1</p>
</text>
